  "pageRules": {
    "majorApproved": "At least 12 credits of major-approved electives, technical courses numbered 2000 or above. At least 6 credits must be from category A, and at least 6 credits must be from outside ORIE. Students are not required to take any credits in category B. At most 3 credits (in total) from ORIE 4900, 4990 and 4999. Other courses, and non-ORIE research, team project or course assistant credits, by petition only.",
    "orieElectives": "At least 9 credits of Operations Research and Engineering electives: all ORIE courses at the 4000 level or higher which are not a Major Required Course and not ORIE 4152, 5142, 5920, 5925 or 9000; additionally ORIE 3320, 3741 and 3800. At most 3 credits of ORIE 4990, and at most 3 credits between ORIE 4900, 4999 and CS 4999."
